OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 14 Oct to Fri 23 Oct
OL,6,FRemaining changeable through this
OL,7,Fperiod, as a series of low pressure
OL,8,Fsystems run across the North Atlantic,
OL,9,Foften to the north and northwest of
OL,10,Fthe UK, bringing occasional bands of
OL,11,Frain and strong winds, but
OL,12,Finterspersed with brighter and more
OL,13,Fshowery conditions. Rain will be most
OL,14,Fprevalent across hills in the west and
OL,15,Fespecially northwest, where above
OL,16,Faverage rainfall is likely through
OL,17,Fthis period. Longer drier interludes
OL,18,Fare more favoured in sheltered
OL,19,Fsouthern and eastern parts, but even
OL,20,Fhere it is likely to be wetter than
OL,21,Fduring recent weeks. Whilst brief
OL,22,Fcooler interludes are possible,
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Ftemperatures are likely to be a little
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fabove average in many areas for the
OL,25,Fperiod as a whole, and potentially
OL,26,Fquite warm in parts of the southeast
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
